<title>JAPAN: Ajinomoto says two officials arrested.</title>
<headline>Ajinomoto says two officials arrested.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajinomoto Co Inc said on Tuesday that two of its officials have been arrested on suspicion of paying several million yen in company funds to &quot;sokaiya&quot; racketeers in violation of Japan's commercial law.</p>
<p>Company president Shunsuke Inamori told a news conference that the two senior officials belonged to the firm's general affairs department, but added that the company's top management had not been involved in the alleged payoffs.</p>
</text>
